          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "text": "$\\frac{2m}{3}$",
          "why": "Cancelled the numbers correctly but wrote the $m$ on the top, when it belongs in the denominator."
        },
        {
          "text": "$\\frac{3m}{2}$",
          "why": "Wrote the fraction upside down, dividing $12m$ by $8$ instead of $8$ by $12m$."
        },
