          "text": "$\\frac{8}{12m}$",
          "why": "Wrote it as a fraction but did not divide top and bottom by the common factor $4$."
        }
      ],
      "solution_text": "$8 \\div 12m$\n$= \\frac{8}{12m}$\n$= \\frac{2}{3m}$"
